<title>USA: Cyprus seeks 25,000 T optional origin barley-trade.</title>
<headline>Cyprus seeks 25,000 T optional origin barley-trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus will tender on Thursday for 25,000 tonnes optional origin feed barley, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for October 15-30.</p>
<p>&quot;It will not be U.S. barley,&quot; one U.S. exporter said of prospective suppliers.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
